; ------------------------------------------------------------
; INVARIANTS
; ------------------------------------------------------------
; Requirement data is engine-derived.
; Requirement readiness does not imply capital feasibility.
; Capital feasibility does not imply authority.
; No construction command is issued here.
; No numeric strategic threshold is introduced here.
; ============================================================
